{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17749","headline":"重送胡大夫赴振武 · 杨巨源","name":"重送胡大夫赴振武","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"向年擢桂儒生业，今日分茅圣主恩。\n旌斾仍将过乡路，轩车争看出都门。\n人间文武能双捷，天下安危待一论。\n布惠宣威大夫事，不妨诗思许琴尊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17749.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17749","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}